{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And if he is poor and his means do not reach.</b> Since we find poverty in the body, as in ״דלות ורעות משכיל״, ״אל דל מדוע אתה ככה דל״ — therefore it specifies for you here, <b>and his means do not reach</b>, to tell you: this is a poor man who has no money."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:12:12.050673737Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}